{"overview":"داستان مردی که وارد یک مسابقه می‌شود، مسابقه‌ای که شرکت‌کننده‌هایش آزاد هستند به هرجای دنیا فرار کنند. فرار از دست آدمکش‌هایی که وظیفه کشتن‌شان را دارند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Desperate to save his sick daughter, working-class Ben Richards is convinced by The Running Man's charming but ruthless producer to enter the deadly competition game as a last resort. But Ben's defiance, instincts, and grit turn him into an unexpected fan favorite — and a threat to the entire system. As ratings skyrocket, so does the danger, and Ben must outwit not just the Hunters, but a nation addicted to watching him fall.","tagline_en":"Hunt him down.","runtime":133,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["ادگار رایت"],"crew_en":["Edgar Wright"],"countries":["US","GB"],"cast":[{"name":"گلن پاول","role":"Ben Richards","photo":"/7eG0GB1GY3RXI7Tg3GoKrLO9mPW.jpg","en":"Glen Powell"},{"name":"کولمن دومینگو","role":"Bobby T.","photo":"/t0cgfvtA7Thxnrtj5baRi656zlc.jpg","en":"Colman Domingo"},{"name":"لی پیس","role":"Evan McCone","photo":"/eeTc0d2AX1vFYVxZ6Qw7qZpg4Tz.jpg","en":"Lee Pace"},{"name":"جاش برولین","role":"Dan Killian","photo":"/sX2etBbIkxRaCsATyw5ZpOVMPTD.jpg","en":"Josh Brolin"},{"name":"ویلیام اچ میسی","role":"Molie","photo":"/hdVEGSrP8qWlJnt0v5vSVcGOjy7.jpg","en":"William H. Macy"},{"name":"مایکل سرا","role":"Elton Perrakis","photo":"/qjhNKsw0OLyZQgK4srhelBafcCf.jpg","en":"Michael Cera"},{"name":"امیلیا جونز","role":"Amelia Williams","photo":"/bYFLZCDsBHxAKePk1tsgQSea3m.jpg","en":"Emilia Jones"},{"name":"دنیل ازرا","role":"Bradley","photo":"/43AIgx8PEABQKkK08OCJ9239OK6.jpg","en":"Daniel Ezra"},{"name":"جیمی لاسون","role":"Sheila Richards","photo":"/1PQmquJ3LRnTnUnut0UZBLZuBuO.jpg","en":"Jayme Lawson"},{"name":"شان هایس","role":"Gary Greenbacks","photo":"/31TI5l5QvcZHN4fh0NpejZyJtP.jpg","en":"Sean Hayes"},{"name":"Katy O'Brian","role":"Jenni Laughlin","photo":"/b7i6dQrHhCYu4Z9bgaXO5U2hrgP.jpg"},{"name":"کارل گلوسمن","role":"'Frank'","photo":"/mTpL